codex
I found the concrete cause: this audit container reports a namespace PID from `getpid()`, while `/proc` is mounted for a different PID namespace; Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, which is absent even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m adding a narrowly scoped preload shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that changes only that procfs lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted preflight function.
